 film's release 2020  was a very ideal environment for  streaming because people didn't have a  lot of options in a world where people  have more entertainment options it's  going to normalize to something i think  bigger than it was prior to the pandemic  streaming new movies at home is  convenient for viewers and for streaming  platforms very profitable agents and  actors know this and experts say that  moving forward they'll start looking for  new and creative ways to negotiate their  way into contracts that cut themselves  in on the streaming profits
 

